{"4901140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drawchemy", "steam_appid": 4901140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PENCIL IS MIGHTIER THAN THE SWORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawchemy</strong> is a physics-based roguelike platformer about solving problems your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, build, and improvise with magical Elements to overcome every challenge. If you can imagine a solution, you can bring it to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW ANYTHING. CREATE EVERYTHING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw directly into the world and watch your creations come to life. Your equipped Element determines what each drawing becomes, from floating balloons and roaring flames to flowing water, portals, bombs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Element opens up new ways to traverse, build, explore, and solve problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN SOLUTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your creations to build bridges, vehicles, machines, and ridiculous physics-driven contraptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use motors, hinges, joints, and other tools to build an elegant machine, brute-force an obstacle, or strap a rocket to a bunny and hope for the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVISE AND EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a roguelike adventure filled with strange worlds, oddball characters, hidden secrets, and dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Elements, tools, and upgrades you find to adapt on the fly, discover unexpected solutions, and make your own way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 replayable worlds with 100+ handcrafted levels and dozens of level modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Elements, each offering distinct gameplay and unique upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full story campaign filled with oddball characters and ancient mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Stickers that enhance your skills and reshape your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing toolbox for building increasingly ambitious creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge collection of cosmetic hats to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended challenges that reward creativity and experimentation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE PENCIL IS MIGHTIER THAN THE SWORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawchemy</strong> is a physics-based roguelike platformer about solving problems your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw, build, and improvise with magical Elements to overcome every challenge. If you can imagine a solution, you can bring it to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/1624e488689859794370f6a93db5a5f8.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAW ANYTHING. CREATE EVERYTHING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw directly into the world and watch your creations come to life. Your equipped Element determines what each drawing becomes, from floating balloons and roaring flames to flowing water, portals, bombs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Element opens up new ways to traverse, build, explore, and solve problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/5bb413fe4d5f6ca4673961b01e299822.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN SOLUTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your creations to build bridges, vehicles, machines, and ridiculous physics-driven contraptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use motors, hinges, joints, and other tools to build an elegant machine, brute-force an obstacle, or strap a rocket to a bunny and hope for the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/45f9401a715720eec55cdad8f21bc4f7.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVISE AND EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a roguelike adventure filled with strange worlds, oddball characters, hidden secrets, and dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Elements, tools, and upgrades you find to adapt on the fly, discover unexpected solutions, and make your own way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.poster.avif?t=1786742514\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.webm?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901140/extras/31cbf0c905d987ac00b15ce7c1b23434.mp4?t=1786742514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 replayable worlds with 100+ handcrafted levels and dozens of level modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Elements, each offering distinct gameplay and unique upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full story campa